# World settings

option.WAVING_PLANTS                   = Zwaaiende Planten
option.WAVING_PLANTS.comment           = Laat grondplanten zoals gras wel of niet zwaaien.\n\n Om een blok te laten zwaaien moet je het blok in shaders/block.properties toevoegen aan de relevante categorie (10016, 10017 of 10018).
option.WAVING_LEAVES                   = Waving Leaves
option.WAVING_LEAVES.comment           = Laat bladeren wel of niet zwaaien.\n\n Om een blok te laten zwaaien moet je het blok in shaders/block.properties toevoegen aan de relevante categorie (10019).
option.SLANTED_RAIN                    = Schuine Regen
option.SLANTED_RAIN.comment            = Schuin vallende regendruppels. Dit ziet er vaak intenser en sfeervoller uit.
option.RAIN_OPACITY                    = Regen Ondoorzichtigheid
option.SNOW_OPACITY                    = Sneeuw Ondoorzichtigheid
option.SNOW_OPACITY.comment            = De ondoorzichtigheid van sneeuwvlokken.
option.EDGE_HIGHLIGHT                  = Lichte Blokranden
option.EDGE_HIGHLIGHT.comment          = Een lichte rand op blokken, geïnspireerd door Minecraft Dungeons.
option.EDGE_HIGHLIGHT_SCALE            = Lichte Blokrand-grootte
option.EDGE_HIGHLIGHT_SCALE.comment    = De dikte van de lichte blokranden. Dit werkt het beste als het hetzelfde als de resolutie van het geactiveerde bronpakket is.
option.MOON_PHASE_AFFECTS_BRIGHTNESS   = Maanfase Wijzigt Belichting
option.MOON_PHASE_AFFECTS_BRIGHTNESS.comment = Maanfase verandert de belichting tijdens nachten.
option.DESERT_SANDSTORM                = Dor/Woestijn Zandstorm
option.DESERT_SANDSTORM.comment        = Vervangt de droge woestijn tijdens regen met een zandstorm.
option.END_GLOW                        = End Gloei
option.END_GLOW.comment                = Gloeiend effect in De End. Vereist Volumetrische Mist.

# Weather
option.RANDOM_WEATHER_VARIATION            = Willekeurige Variatie
option.RANDOM_WEATHER_VARIATION.comment = Controls random variation.
option.BIOME_WEATHER_VARIATION             = Bioom-gebaseerde Variatie
option.BIOME_WEATHER_VARIATION.comment = Controls biome-based variation.
option.WEATHER_TEMPERATURE_BIAS            = Temperatuursaanpassing
option.WEATHER_TEMPERATURE_BIAS.comment = Controls temperature bias.
option.WEATHER_HUMIDITY_BIAS               = Vochtigheidsaanpassing
option.WEATHER_HUMIDITY_BIAS.comment = Controls humidity bias.
option.WEATHER_WIND_BIAS                   = Winderigheidsaanpassing
option.WEATHER_WIND_BIAS.comment = Controls windiness bias.
option.WEATHER_TEMPERATURE_VARIATION_SPEED = Temperatuursvariatie-snelheid
option.WEATHER_TEMPERATURE_VARIATION_SPEED.comment = Controls temperature variation speed.
option.WEATHER_HUMIDITY_VARIATION_SPEED    = Vochtigheidsvariatie-snelheid
option.WEATHER_HUMIDITY_VARIATION_SPEED.comment = Controls humidity variation speed.
option.WEATHER_WIND_VARIATION_SPEED        = Winderigheidsvariatie-snelheid
option.WEATHER_WIND_VARIATION_SPEED.comment = Controls windiness variation speed.

# Lighting settings

option.COLORED_LIGHTS                  = Gekleurde Lichtbronnen
option.COLORED_LIGHTS.comment          = Gekleurd bloklicht door gebruik te maken van het 'Iris Floodfill-algoritme'. Werkt niet bij Iris versies onder de 1.6.
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_MODE        = Vastgehouden Belichting
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_MODE.comment       = Voorwerpen die je vasthoud werpen licht op de omgeving. Dit heeft kleur als Gekleurde Lichtbronnen aanstaat.
value.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_MODE.0                       = Off
value.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_MODE.1                     = Normal
value.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_MODE.2                    = Colored
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_INTENSITY     = Vastgehouden Belichting Felheid
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_INTENSITY.comment = Wijzigt de felheid van vastgehouden belichting.
option.AO_IN_SUNLIGHT                  = AO In Zonlicht
option.AO_IN_SUNLIGHT.comment          = Of omgevingsocclusie wel of niet in direct zonlicht mag verschijnen.
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS                   = Wolkschaduwen
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS.comment           = Schaduwen die door wolken worden geworpen.
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS_INTENSITY         = Wolkschaduw Intensiteit
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS_INTENSITY.comment = Wijzigt de intensiteit van wolkschaduwen.
option.SH_SKYLIGHT                     = SH Skylight
option.SH_SKYLIGHT.comment             = Gebruikt een 'Spherical Harmonics'-codering voor directioneel licht van de lucht, wat een heel natuurlijk resultaat creëert.\nDit werkt goed samen met GTAO.
option.SH_SKYLIGHT_QUALITY=Quality
option.SH_SKYLIGHT_QUALITY.comment=Controls the quality of the live sky projection. Higher settings use more sky samples for smoother, more accurate skylight at higher GPU cost.
option.SSS_SHEEN                       = SSS Glans
option.SSS_SHEEN.comment               = Creëert een glans-effect op planten en bladeren. Dit helpt planten om minder ruw tegen het glimmende gras op te laten vallen.
option.SSS_INTENSITY.comment           = Wijzigt de felheid van 'Subsurface Scattering (SSS)'.
option.SHADING_STRENGTH                = Belichtingsintensiteit
option.SHADING_STRENGTH.comment        = Wijzigt de intensiteit van directe belichting. Lagere waarden maken oppervlakken die van de zon weg wijzen feller, hogere waarden maken de oppervlakken donkerder.

option.SHADOW                          = Shadows
option.SHADOW.comment = Enables shadows cast by the sun and moon onto the world. Disable for maximum performance — no shadows will be rendered.
option.SHADOW_PCF                      = Shadowmap Filtering
option.SHADOW_PCF.comment = Softens shadow edges using percentage-closer filtering. When enabled, shadows look smoother and less pixelated.
option.SHADOW_SSRT                     = Distant Shadows
option.SHADOW_SSRT.comment = Extends shadows beyond the shadow map distance using screen-space ray tracing. Fills in far shadows without increasing shadow map size. Moderate performance cost.
option.SHADOW_SSRT_STEPS               = Distant Shadow Quality
option.SHADOW_SSRT_STEPS.comment = Adjusts the number of ray steps for screen-space distant shadows. Higher = more accurate, less noisy far shadows at higher GPU cost.
option.SHADOW_COLOR                    = Gekleurde Schaduwen
option.SHADOW_COLOR.comment            = Doorzichtige blokken werpen gekleurde schaduwen.
option.SHADOW_VPS                      = Bijschaduwen
option.SHADOW_VPS.comment              = Schaduwen krijgen zachtere randen naarmate de oppervlakte verder van het schaduw-werpende voorwerp is.
option.shadowMapResolution             = Shadow Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment = Adjusts the size of the shadow map texture. Higher = sharper, more detailed shadows at higher VRAM and GPU cost.
option.shadowDistance                  = Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment = Maximum distance shadows are rendered, in blocks. Higher values show shadows farther away but reduce detail per block and increase cost.
option.sunPathRotation                 = Sun Path Tilt
option.sunPathRotation.comment = Tilts the sun and moon path across the sky in degrees. Negative values tilt south. Affects time-of-day lighting direction.
option.SHADOW_PENUMBRA_SCALE           = Shadow Softness
option.SHADOW_PENUMBRA_SCALE.comment   = Scales the overall softness of all shadows. Lower = sharper hard shadows, higher = larger, softer penumbras.
option.ENTITY_SHADOWS                  = Entity Shadows
option.ENTITY_SHADOWS.comment          = When enabled, living entities and dropped items cast shadows.
Disable to improve performance in survival bases with large farms.
option.BLOCK_ENTITY_SHADOWS            = Block Entity Shadows
option.BLOCK_ENTITY_SHADOWS.comment = When enabled, chests, signs, banners and other block entities cast shadows. Lower cost than full entity shadows.
option.PIXELATED_SHADOWS               = Pixelated Shadows
option.PIXELATED_SHADOWS.comment       = Shadows snap to the block texel grid, creating a retro pixelated look. For stylistic screenshots.
option.PIXELATED_SHADOWS_RESOLUTION    = Pixel Size
option.PIXELATED_SHADOWS_RESOLUTION.comment = Adjusts the texel grid size for pixelated shadows. Lower = chunkier, more blocky pixels.
option.SSS_STEPS                       = SSS Stappen
option.SSS_STEPS.comment               = Hogere waarden verminderen ruis maar verslechteren de prestaties.

option.SHADER_AO                       = Shader AO
option.SHADER_AO.comment               = Het AO type dat wordt gebruikt.\nSSAO: Lagere kwaliteit, maar betere prestaties.\nGTAO: Hogere kwaliteit, maar slechtere prestaties.
value.SHADER_AO.SHADER_AO_NONE         = Uit
value.SHADER_AO.SHADER_AO_SSAO         = SSAO
value.SHADER_AO.SHADER_AO_GTAO         = GTAO
option.VANILLA_AO                      = Vanilla AO
option.VANILLA_AO.comment              = Minecraft's ingebouwde omgevingsocclusie.
option.SSAO_RADIUS                     = SSAO Radius
option.SSAO_RADIUS.comment             = Wijzigt de radius van SSAO. Hogere waarden zorgen ervoor dat voorwerpen verder weg omgevingsocclusie kunnen creëren.
option.SSAO_STEPS                      = SSAO Stappen
option.SSAO_STEPS.comment              = Wijzigt hoeveel stappen SSAO zet en vermindert het ruis in de omgevingsocclusie.
option.GTAO_RADIUS                     = GTAO Radius
option.GTAO_RADIUS.comment             = Wijzigt de radius van GTAO. Hogere waarden zorgen ervoor dat voorwerpen verder weg omgevingsocclusie kunnen creëren.
option.GTAO_SLICES                     = GTAO Delen
option.GTAO_SLICES.comment             = Wijzigt hoeveel 'slices' GTAO gebruikt. Hogere waarden verminderen ruis, maar kosten meer prestaties.
option.GTAO_HORIZON_STEPS              = GTAO Stappen
option.GTAO_HORIZON_STEPS.comment      = Wijzigt hoeveel stappen GTAO zet en dus hoe precies de omgevingsocclusie is.\nAls kleine voorwerpen geen omgevingsocclusie creëeren is het handig deze instelling hoger te zetten.\nMeer stappen zorgt ook voor een donkerdere omgevingsocclusie.

option.SUN_NR                          = §c▍ §fRed — Noon
option.SUN_NR.comment = Adjusts the red tint of sunlight at noon. Higher = warmer midday sun.
option.SUN_NG                          = §a▍ §fGreen — Noon
option.SUN_NG.comment = Adjusts the green tint of sunlight at noon. Higher = less pink, more neutral daylight.
option.SUN_NB                          = §9▍ §fBlue — Noon
option.SUN_NB.comment = Adjusts the blue tint of sunlight at noon. Higher = cooler, more bluish midday light.
option.SUN_MR                          = §c▍ §fRed — Morning
option.SUN_MR.comment = Adjusts the red tint of sunlight at sunrise. Higher = warmer, redder dawn light.
option.SUN_MG                          = §a▍ §fGreen — Morning
option.SUN_MG.comment = Adjusts the green tint of sunlight at sunrise. Affects the balance between orange and yellow dawn.
option.SUN_MB                          = §9▍ §fBlue — Morning
option.SUN_MB.comment = Adjusts the blue tint of sunlight at sunrise. Higher = less orange, more neutral morning.
option.SUN_ER                          = §c▍ §fRed — Evening
option.SUN_ER.comment = Adjusts the red tint of sunlight at sunset. Higher = warmer, redder dusk light.
option.SUN_EG                          = §a▍ §fGreen — Evening
option.SUN_EG.comment = Adjusts the green tint of sunlight at sunset. Affects the balance between orange and yellow dusk.
option.SUN_EB                          = §9▍ §fBlue — Evening
option.SUN_EB.comment = Adjusts the blue tint of sunlight at sunset. Higher = cooler, less orange evening light.
option.SUN_I                           = Sunlight Intensity
option.SUN_I.comment = Adjusts the overall brightness of direct sunlight. Higher = brighter sun, stronger highlights and shadows.
option.MOON_R                          = §c▍ §fRed — Moonlight
option.MOON_R.comment = Adjusts the red tint of moonlight. Higher = warmer night light.
option.MOON_G                          = §a▍ §fGreen — Moonlight
option.MOON_G.comment = Adjusts the green tint of moonlight. Affects the coolness of night lighting.
option.MOON_B                          = §9▍ §fBlue — Moonlight
option.MOON_B.comment = Adjusts the blue tint of moonlight. Higher = cooler, more bluish nights.
option.MOON_I                          = Moonlight Intensity
option.MOON_I.comment = Adjusts the overall brightness of moonlight. Higher = brighter nights, more visible shadows at night.
option.LIGHTNING_FLASH                 = Bliksemflits
option.LIGHTNING_FLASH.comment = Controls lightning flash.
option.NETHER_USE_BIOME_COLOR          = Use Biome Color
option.NETHER_USE_BIOME_COLOR.comment = When enabled, Nether fog and ambient color adapts to the current biome. When disabled, uses the static color below.
option.NETHER_I                        = Nether Fog Intensity
option.NETHER_I.comment = Adjusts the overall brightness of Nether fog and ambient light. Higher = brighter, more washed-out Nether.
option.NETHER_S                        = Nether Fog Saturation
option.NETHER_S.comment = Adjusts the color vividness of Nether fog. Higher = more saturated orange/red, lower = more grey.
option.NETHER_R                        = §c▍ §fRed — Nether
option.NETHER_R.comment = Adjusts the red tint of the static Nether ambient color (when Use Biome Color is off).
option.NETHER_G                        = §a▍ §fGreen — Nether
option.NETHER_G.comment = Adjusts the green tint of the static Nether ambient color. Affects the orange-to-yellow balance.
option.NETHER_B                        = §9▍ §fBlue — Nether
option.NETHER_B.comment = Adjusts the blue tint of the static Nether ambient color. Higher = more purple/cooler Nether.
option.END_LIGHT_R                     = §c▍ §fRed — End Light
option.END_LIGHT_R.comment = Adjusts the red tint of direct light in the End (from the central light source).
option.END_LIGHT_G                     = §a▍ §fGreen — End Light
option.END_LIGHT_G.comment = Adjusts the green tint of direct light in the End.
option.END_LIGHT_B                     = §9▍ §fBlue — End Light
option.END_LIGHT_B.comment = Adjusts the blue tint of direct light in the End. Higher = cooler, more bluish End light.
option.END_LIGHT_I                     = End Direct Intensity
option.END_LIGHT_I.comment = Adjusts the brightness of direct light in the End. Higher = stronger highlights from the End light source.
option.END_AMBIENT_R                   = §c▍ §fRed — End Ambient
option.END_AMBIENT_R.comment = Adjusts the red tint of ambient skylight in the End.
option.END_AMBIENT_G                   = §a▍ §fGreen — End Ambient
option.END_AMBIENT_G.comment = Adjusts the green tint of ambient skylight in the End.
option.END_AMBIENT_B                   = §9▍ §fBlue — End Ambient
option.END_AMBIENT_B.comment = Adjusts the blue tint of ambient skylight in the End. Higher = more violet/blue ambient.
option.END_AMBIENT_I                   = End Ambient Intensity
option.END_AMBIENT_I.comment = Adjusts the brightness of ambient skylight in the End. Higher = less contrast, more evenly lit.
option.BLOCKLIGHT_R                    = §c▍ §fRed — Block Light
option.BLOCKLIGHT_R.comment = Adjusts the red tint of artificial block lights (torches, lanterns, glowstone). Higher = warmer block light.
option.BLOCKLIGHT_G                    = §a▍ §fGreen — Block Light
option.BLOCKLIGHT_G.comment = Adjusts the green tint of block lights. Affects the orange-to-yellow balance of torch light.
option.BLOCKLIGHT_B                    = §9▍ §fBlue — Block Light
option.BLOCKLIGHT_B.comment = Adjusts the blue tint of block lights. Higher = cooler, whiter light.
option.BLOCKLIGHT_I                    = Block Light Intensity
option.BLOCKLIGHT_I.comment = Adjusts the overall brightness of block light sources. Higher = stronger torch and lamp illumination.

option.VOXEL_VOLUME_SIZE               = Voxel Volume Grootte
option.VOXEL_VOLUME_SIZE.comment       = Wijzigt hoe ver weg gekleurde lichtbronnen zichtbaar zijn.\nHogere waarden verminderen sterk prestaties.. Ook beïnvloed door shaduwafstand.
